Update `tasks/lessons.md` when decompile outcomes diverge from TFS assumptions, or edge cases are found.

## Verification

Before completing any port:
1. Major functions have C++ references (772 outcomes + TFS structure where both apply)
2. Era-tuned constants match the active profile / decompile (not accidental 1098 leftovers)
3. Edge cases mirror the **active-era** reference
